Author: vincent <vincent@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Wed Oct 28 00:22:13 2026 +1000

    gateway: vLLM refuses custom_tool_call input items, translated on retry (#3849)
    
    Codex compaction requests carry custom_tool_call items in history with
    empty tools array; vLLM returns 400 'Unsupported input item type:
    custom_tool_call'. The refusal was not recognized (regex missed input
    item type wording, hasCustomTool missed items without 'custom' string).
    Now the regex matches vLLM's wording, hasCustomTool checks for
    custom_tool_call/custom_tool_call_output items directly, and the retry
    translates them to function_call/function_call_output.
    
    TestCodexCompactionOverCustomToolCalls and TestCustomToolRefusalWordings_VLLM
    red then green; existing custom tool tests green.
    
    Rebased onto main 8abdf53a8: customToolRefusal keeps #3392's 'unknown
    variant' alternative beside the new input-item-type one; the test file
    gained its missing trailing newline. TestCustomToolRefusalWordings and
    the xAI compaction tests still green.

